  "details": "Although this might not be the best idea, I thought I should toss the idea out there to see what everyone thinks. I had the idea that there could be a device in worlds that allowed a player in-game to connect with their steam account or PC and share or stream their PC desktop in real time. It could be done with a media device in worlds or maybe even as a feature like a player’s camera in-game with perhaps a spawnable in-game tablet.",
